  m_text: 'Welcome to a bright and exciting world! In this addictive arcade game
    you will become a real fruit collecting master. Your task is to click on small
    fruits to increase their size. The faster you do this, the more fruit you can
    collect!



    Each level offers unique fruits with different characteristics
    and timers. You have a limited time to bring the fruits to the desired size and
    send them to the basket. Be careful! If you do not have time to collect all the
    fruits before the time runs out, the level will be lost.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: abfe2722a3e15c349937a37713e3c56f, type: 2}
